WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.483
Today we will strengthen performance through reflection. Our work connects with

00:00:04.483 --> 00:00:06.429
Ghanaian and other African artists.

00:00:07.283 --> 00:00:10.675
Identify one timing or storytelling issue from feedback.

00:00:11.533 --> 00:00:16.412
Rehearse a concrete change as a group. Record why your chosen technique suits the

00:00:16.412 --> 00:00:16.760
message.

00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:21.222
Restage the piece and explain the difference between the two versions.
